  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Frontline Women&#x2019;s Fund (FWF)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Frontline Women&#x2019;s Fund (FWF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Frontline Women&apos;s Fund &#xe4;r en fond f&#xf6;r kvinnor som st&#xe4;rker kvinnor&#xe4;ttsaktivister som verkar i frontlinjen mot m&#xe4;nniskohandel runt om i v&#xe4;rlden genom att &#xf6;ka deras tillg&#xe5;ng till ekonomiska resurser, politiska ledare och synlighet i media. Genomf&#xf6;randet av FWF:s aktiviteter syftar till att uppn&#xe5; global j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Frontline Women&apos;s Fund is a fund for women that empowers women&apos;s rights activists working on the front lines against human trafficking around the world by increasing their access to financial resources, political leaders and media visibility. The implementation of FWF&apos;s activities aims to achieve global gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
